@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.47.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.47.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.46.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.47.0 (2026-11-25): Owner ruling: the portraits of public figures in the story pictures (chapter 16 slides 25, 30, 40; chapter 17 slides 6, 40) stay. Correction: the owner never ruled against such portraits; that rule was the building agent's own limit on what it downloads and inserts, wrongly carried into this lineage's records as an owner rule and raised as an owner question. The open items of the earlier audit notes about it are void."""@en .

ex:TK10_Release_16_Build backlog:hasAuditNote "Owner ruling 2026-11-25: the portraits stay. The open item 'portraits await the owner' in the 1.46.0 note and in the chapter 16 and 17 review records is void; the portrait question was the agent's own, not an owner rule." .
